{
  "hero_headline": "全球关税风暴将至，AI 技术与代理人开发进入工业落地深水区 / Global Tariff Storm Looms as AI and Agent Development Enter Industrial Deployment",
  "daily_overview": "本周全球财经与政治领域正经历剧烈震荡，美国准备向全球贸易伙伴加征关税，引发金融市场波动及对通胀与加息预期的重新评估。与此同时，科技界重心已转向 AI 应用的深度集成，端侧 AI 与代理人（Agent）开发成为核心议题，企业不仅忙于将 AI 部署至复杂网络，还面临算力利用与安全性挑战。地缘政治局势持续紧张，从刚果冲突升级到围绕芯片与贸易的法律博弈，全球化供应链正承受着前所未有的压力与重构。在金融与科技的双重博弈下，传统行业与新兴技术产业正面临深刻的调整与适应过程。\n\nThis week, the global financial and political landscapes are undergoing severe volatility as the US prepares to impose new tariffs on trade partners, fueling market concerns over inflation and potential interest rate hikes. Simultaneously, the tech industry has pivoted toward deep AI integration, with edge AI and Agent-based development taking center stage. Enterprises are grappling with infrastructure strain and security challenges while navigating a volatile geopolitical environment defined by regional conflicts and ongoing trade disputes, marking a period of profound structural change for global supply chains.",
